132		fmt.Println("  Without --missed-since-seq the missed-duty alarm uses the cumulative")
133		fmt.Println("  missed count of the latest heartbeat (missed in the output). With it,")
134		fmt.Println("  the alarm counts only missed duties newly recorded between the baseline")
135		fmt.Println("  heartbeat seq S and the latest one; a count strictly greater than")
136		fmt.Println("  --tolerated-misses alarms, equality does not. The output then shows the")
137		fmt.Println("  baseline seq, the baseline cumulative count and the new count. If the")
138		fmt.Println("  cumulative counter decreased between the baseline and the latest record")
139		fmt.Println("  (e.g. after a node reset), the new count is shown as 无法判断 and a")
